WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.410
As you can see on the right, there is an update for the AI Detector.

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:09.310
It pops up when your computer starts and an update is available.

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.590
So how do you update?

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:16.810
At the bottom right of the taskbar there is a small arrow.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:21.430
Click it and a very small menu opens.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.590
The AI Detector is in here.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.510
Here it is still black because I have an old version, but yours is green.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:35.630
Right-click it and choose Check for Updates.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:39.190
Then it tells you: there is an update.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.850
In this case version 1.0.1.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:47.090
Or it says there is no update and you are up to date, which is fine too.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:49.990
Updating is simple: click Yes.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:53.190
You don't have to do anything else.

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:56.910
The old version is simply updated to the new one.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.410
It's that simple.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.390
When it is done, a pop-up appears.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:02.770
The update is ready.

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:05.870
Ready to restart the AI Detector?

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:10.690
Monitoring pauses briefly before it starts again.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.430
Then you click Yes.

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:15.990
Then it installs the update.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.740
And when it is done, it starts automatically and it has been updated.

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:25.560
It can be that simple.
